Description: Portable ZX Spectrum emulator (wxWidgets desktop UI)
 Portable ZX-Spectrum emulator based on UnrealSpeccy by SMT.
 Supports Z80 128K (Pentagon), AY/YM, Beeper, Beta Disk, Tape,
 Kempston Joystick/Mouse, Snapshots and Replays.
 .
 Supported formats: sna, z80, szx, rzx, tap, tzx, csw,
 trd, scl, fdi, td0, udi, zip.
 .
 This variant uses a native wxWidgets desktop UI (menus, dialogs,
 file manager) with OpenAL Soft audio and OpenGL/GLEW rendering,
 instead of the SDL2-based UI. Ships under a different binary name
 and can be installed alongside unreal-speccy-portable (SDL2).
